<title>POLAND: ELEKTRIM MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 2.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTRIM MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 2.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.60 vs   1.87</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.34 vs   8.45</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.05 vs   3.34</p>
<p> Sales		   74.02 vs  82.69</p>
<p> JANUARY-MARCH	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     7.25 vs   6.90</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	12.81 vs  24.34</p>
<p> Operating profit    16.35 vs  15.33</p>
<p> Sales		  203.24 vs 197.85</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish industrial and trading</p>
<p>conglomerate is Elektrim SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
